    scenario: 'A buyer at a car dealership spends twenty minutes enthusing about a red hatchback and asking about its colours. Only at the very end, almost as an afterthought, does she ask the price of the grey estate she came in for, and she negotiates hard on it while the salesman is still thinking about the hatchback.',
