    shadow: 'Calculated honesty is fragile: once people see the calculation, every past kindness is reread as a con, and the fall is devastating. Those who use honesty as a tactic often lose the ability to be honest for its own sake. In the long run consistent truthfulness, including when it costs you, builds far stronger trust than strategic candour ever can.',
